{"id":"78d84752064c9948","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-boolean-topos.md","title":"Definition — Boolean Topos","display":"Definition — Boolean Topos","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-boolean-topos","aliases":["14-df-boolean-topos"],"display":"Definition — Boolean Topos","depends_on":["[[14-df-category]]","[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","[[14-df-heyting-negation]]","[[14-df-subobjects]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-boolean-topos"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-boolean-topos</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — Boolean Topos"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" href=\"?note=4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" title=\"14-df-elementary-topos\">14-df-elementary-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"42b2e2d4b9f8fe9c\" href=\"?note=42b2e2d4b9f8fe9c\" title=\"14-df-heyting-negation\">14-df-heyting-negation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d3923e299ec2ec5a\" href=\"?note=d3923e299ec2ec5a\" title=\"14-df-subobjects\">14-df-subobjects</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a> 的候选范畴；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" href=\"?note=4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" title=\"14-df-elementary-topos\">14-df-elementary-topos</a>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为初等拓扑斯时，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span>，采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"42b2e2d4b9f8fe9c\" href=\"?note=42b2e2d4b9f8fe9c\" title=\"14-df-heyting-negation\">14-df-heyting-negation</a> 及其依赖中明确给出的子对象 Heyting 结构与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Neg}_X\">\\(\\mathrm{Neg}_X\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vee\">\\(\\vee\\)</span> 表示该结构的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vee_X\">\\(\\vee_X\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsBoolean}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsBoolean}\\)</span> 是以下定义的谓词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsBoolean}(\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}(\\mathcal E)\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)\\;(A\\vee\\mathrm{Neg}_X(A)=\\top_X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsBoolean}(\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}(\\mathcal E)\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)\\;(A\\vee\\mathrm{Neg}_X(A)=\\top_X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：VI.1 The Topos of Sets；VI.4 The Axiom of Choice。</p>\n<p>每个子对象代数满足排中律即为布尔拓扑斯；等价于每个子对象的双重否定等于自身。在一般拓扑斯中不能默认这些等价条件成立。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-heyting-negation","status":"resolved","id":"42b2e2d4b9f8fe9c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-heyting-negation]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobjects","status":"resolved","id":"d3923e299ec2ec5a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobjects]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为 [[14-df-category]] 的候选范畴；$\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}$ 见 [[14-df-elementary-topos]]。当 $\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯时，对每个 $X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)$，采用 [[14-df-heyting-negation]] 及其依赖中明确给出的子对象 Heyting 结构与 $\\mathrm{Neg}_X$；$\\vee$ 表示该结构的 $\\vee_X$。$\\mathrm{IsBoolean}$ 是以下定义的谓词。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为 [[14-df-category]] 的候选范畴；$\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}$ 见 [[14-df-elementary-topos]]。当 $\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯时，对每个 $X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)$，采用 [[14-df-heyting-negation]] 及其依赖中明确给出的子对象 Heyting 结构与 $\\mathrm{Neg}_X$；$\\vee$ 表示该结构的 $\\vee_X$。$\\mathrm{IsBoolean}$ 是以下定义的谓词。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-heyting-negation","status":"resolved","id":"42b2e2d4b9f8fe9c","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为 [[14-df-category]] 的候选范畴；$\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}$ 见 [[14-df-elementary-topos]]。当 $\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯时，对每个 $X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)$，采用 [[14-df-heyting-negation]] 及其依赖中明确给出的子对象 Heyting 结构与 $\\mathrm{Neg}_X$；$\\vee$ 表示该结构的 $\\vee_X$。$\\mathrm{IsBoolean}$ 是以下定义的谓词。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Neg}_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\vee","display":false},{"tex":"\\vee_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsBoolean}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsBoolean}(\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}(\\mathcal E)\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)\\;(A\\vee\\mathrm{Neg}_X(A)=\\top_X)","display":true}],"bytes":1339,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-128","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-boolean-topos|Definition — Boolean Topos]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-42","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-boolean-topos]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-42","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-boolean-topos]]"},{"id":"c1caa9c6c6dfe850","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-129","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-boolean-topos|Definition — Boolean Topos]]"},{"id":"1d4177d202e67eb5","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯，$\\operatorname{IAC}$ 与 $\\operatorname{AC}$ 见 [[14-df-choice-axioms]]；布尔性见 [[14-df-boolean-topos]]，$\\mathrm{Neg}_X$ 是 [[14-df-heyting-negation]] 的子对象伪补。"},{"id":"ddd71b28b9e13b9b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0e7878d33550867c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["282